        <mxCell id="header-sub" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e2e8f0&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Every zoom on one canvas: how a user, an app, an agent and a release cross the platform, and what the AI landing zone adds&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Scope: on-prem hub and its EKS and GKE targets, 2026-10-22 · drawn in full: what the proposals add (P0–P2, IA-1–IA-3) · faded: what already runs&lt;br&gt;Out of scope: observability (ai-gateway view) · cnp.sh and Terraform state (multicloud view) · RBAC and grants (access-matrix view) · per-cluster policies (multicloud-policies view) · what runs on the GPU server&lt;br&gt;Assumed: agentgateway on its own GatewayClass, beside Envoy Gateway; Gemini free tier first, the GPU server on 429 or for Local projects&lt;br&gt;v0.1 · source: cnp-docs/architecture/cnp&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#94a3b8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
